&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in science or related field or 2+ years of related experience. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience in laboratory settings, quality settings, or chemical production facilities.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
