&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Adept with data acquisition and analysis tools including Laboratory Information Management Systems and Microsoft Office. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal communication, and collaboration skills &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
