&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;director&amp;nbsp;will work directly with leadership and functional leaders, serving as the company&#39;s primary&amp;nbsp;marketing&amp;nbsp;voice and building systems that grow sustainably as the company scales.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
