&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Product&amp;nbsp;Marketing&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; GTM Strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Develop and own the positioning and messaging architecture for each business line — recycling, materials, and Redwood Energy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Lead go-to-market strategy for new product launches, partnership announcements, and commercial milestones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Build audience intelligence: define&amp;nbsp;customer personas, map decision journeys, and pressure-test messaging with commercial and BD teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Own competitive positioning and ensure the&amp;nbsp;marketing&amp;nbsp;function stays ahead&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;its&amp;nbsp;competitive landscape&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Develop sales and enablement materials: one-pagers, pitch decks, capability briefs, RFP response frameworks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
