&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Help set and protect the Redwood Materials brand voice, visual standards, and editorial POV across all channels and business lines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development of a company-level story that unifies business lines under a coherent mission and positions Redwood as the defining company in domestic battery circularity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Translate deeply technical work into clear, credible narratives for non-technical audiences without losing precision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; System Building&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Build the operating system for the marketing function: editorial calendar, campaign frameworks, asset library, analytics stack&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Establish trust and direct working relationships with product, BD, policy, and communications counterparts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Integration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Maintain alignment with leadership on strategic priorities and emerging narrative opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Partner with PR and communications to coordinate earned media, executive profiling, brand reputation and crisis response&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;10+ years in B2B product marketing, with at least 3 years leading a team or function&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Deep experience in technical product storytelling — clean energy, advanced manufacturing, industrial tech, defense tech, or similar domains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and own full go-to-market strategy, including campaign execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Strong writing skills – can draft an executive brief, a customer-facing one-pager, and a conference keynote outline &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Experience marketing to enterprise procurement/BD audiences, government or policy stakeholders, and engineering talent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Comfort operating without a large team or big agency support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Redwood&#39;s market position is sharper and better known among&amp;nbsp;enterprise&amp;nbsp;and technical&amp;nbsp;audiences.&amp;nbsp;Redwood’s channels tell a powerful and clear story of the company’s products,&amp;nbsp;strengths&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;vision.&amp;nbsp;The marketing&amp;nbsp;function&amp;nbsp;runs&amp;nbsp;as a system&amp;nbsp;driving strategic storylines and supporting company goals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
