&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;page&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;layoutArea&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Redwood Materials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Redwood Materials was founded in 2017 by JB Straubel, co-founder and former CTO of Tesla, on a simple but radical idea: the critical minerals powering the energy transition already exist. They just need to come back. Today Redwood is the largest lithium-ion battery recycler in North America — recovering, refining, and redeploying critical minerals from end-of-life batteries back into the supply chain. On the energy side, Redwood has deployed the largest second-life battery project in the world, delivering power to AI data centers in months rather than years using proprietary energy architecture engineered entirely in-house. The company is profitable, the market it operates in is projected to grow 20 to 50 times over the next decade, and Redwood is the only company with the supply chain, the technology, and the operational scale to lead it.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;37&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;37&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt; The Logistics Analyst, Inbound/Outbound will be a key member of the Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) Logistics Operations team at Redwood Materials. This person will be responsible for coordinating inbound raw material and feedstock freight into BESS operations, ensuring internal stakeholders and supplier requirements are met. The role operates out of the Battery Materials Campus (BMC) in Sparks, Nevada. The Logistics Analyst will plan and optimize inbound flows within a growing logistics network, including international and hazardous material (hazmat) shipping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;38&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;38&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;39&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;39,0,0&quot;&gt;Prepare and coordinate inbound/outbound receiving schedules with suppliers and carriers to ensure on-time logistics execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;39,1,0&quot;&gt;Communicate shipment information to carriers, internal stakeholders, and customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;39,2,0&quot;&gt;Manage logistics operations through various modes of transportation, interact with Third-Party Logistics (3PL) providers, and collect shipping data in a Transportation Management System (TMS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;39,3,0&quot;&gt;Prepare pertinent shipping documents, including international transportation and hazardous material (hazmat) shipping documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;39,4,0&quot;&gt;Develop reporting tools and track key performance metrics of logistics performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;39,5,0&quot;&gt;Monitor shipping costs and optimize logistics routing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;39,6,0&quot;&gt;Communicate with internal stakeholders, customers, and Third-Party Logistics (3PL) providers to meet operational demands and creatively solve problems when issues arise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;40&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;40&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Skills, Knowledge, and Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;41&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;41,0,0&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree and/or equivalent relevant experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of professional experience in the logistics field required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;41,1,0&quot;&gt;Preference for Supply Chain Management, Finance, or Analytics majors, or Master’s degree&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;41,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience with Transportation Management Systems (TMS) and Third-Party Logistics (3PL) coordination preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;41,4,0&quot;&gt;Passion for sustainability and making the world a better place&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The position is full-time. Compensation will be commensurate with experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
