&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior Service Engineer, Energy Storage resolves complex technical issues across deployed battery energy storage systems (BESS). The role serves as the technical escalation path for the operations and maintenance organization, which handles routine monitoring, preventive maintenance, and first-line troubleshooting. The position independently owns deep diagnostics, system-level failure analysis, and engineering-driven corrective actions. It bridges field operations and engineering by translating operational issues into engineering solutions and feeding field learnings back into product and system design. This is a fully on-site role at 100 Hooper in San Francisco, with semi-regular travel to field sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
