vironment, with regular presence on the operating floor and periodic travel to support the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77657302 BCX0&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77657302 BCX0&quot;&gt; team and field service operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW77657302 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
