&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Redwood Materials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Redwood Materials was founded in 2017 by JB Straubel, co-founder and former CTO of Tesla, on a simple but radical idea: the critical minerals powering the energy transition already exist. They just need to come back. Today Redwood is the largest lithium-ion battery recycler in North America — recovering, refining, and redeploying critical minerals from end-of-life batteries back into the supply chain. On the energy side, Redwood has deployed the largest second-life battery project in the world, delivering power to AI data centers in months rather than years using proprietary energy architecture engineered entirely in-house. The company is profitable, the market it operates in is projected to grow 20 to 50 times over the next decade, and Redwood is the only company with the supply chain, the technology, and the operational scale to lead it.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt;Redwood Materials is currently seeking a Staff Architect to join our Infrastructure Development team. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt; role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt; is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt; at the center of our activities focused on creating a sustainable circular economy for lithium-ion batteries by transforming recycled materials into battery materials for new lithium-ion battery production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt; In t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt;his role you will lead architectural design and code compliance for large-scale industrial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt;battery recycling &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt;facilities from concept through construction. You will serve as Architect of Record on designated projects, act as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt;a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202983092 BCX8&quot;&gt;primary liaison to Authorities Having Jurisdiction, and mentor a growing internal design team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
