&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with short circuit and protective relay software tools such as ASPEN and/or CAPE is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PSCAD and/or PSS/E is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python for analysis automation or data processing is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
